WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.253
A jailbroken AI agent spent

00:00:02.053 --> 00:00:04.057
two weeks inside a European

00:00:03.857 --> 00:00:06.160
telecom, and its attacker left

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:06.987
the notes out.

00:00:07.687 --> 00:00:09.745
Malbear Labs found over seventy

00:00:09.545 --> 00:00:10.502
session logs.

00:00:10.542 --> 00:00:12.064
The operator sent a few

00:00:11.864 --> 00:00:12.924
short messages.

00:00:12.964 --> 00:00:14.396
The agent picked its own

00:00:14.196 --> 00:00:15.505
targets and exploits.

00:00:16.055 --> 00:00:17.728
It ran on a jailbroken

00:00:17.528 --> 00:00:19.822
Deep Seek model with no refusals.

00:00:19.862 --> 00:00:22.274
Smaller workers each ran one task.

00:00:22.824 --> 00:00:24.016
The way in was a

00:00:23.816 --> 00:00:25.694
Cisco BroadWorks flaw,

00:00:25.494 --> 00:00:27.373
rated seven point five out

00:00:27.173 --> 00:00:28.975
of ten and fixed in August.

00:00:29.525 --> 00:00:31.686
Then it moved sideways,

00:00:31.486 --> 00:00:33.735
through Liferay and J Boss

00:00:33.535 --> 00:00:35.695
bugs from 2020 and 2013,

00:00:35.495 --> 00:00:37.923
to thirteen hosted companies.

00:00:38.473 --> 00:00:40.152
When defences stopped it,

00:00:39.952 --> 00:00:41.570
the agent rewrote its tools.

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:43.218
Old tricks, but nobody had

00:00:43.018 --> 00:00:44.098
to think of them at

00:00:43.898 --> 00:00:45.096
three in the morning.

00:00:45.646 --> 00:00:47.584
Malbear says it reached private

00:00:47.384 --> 00:00:49.257
keys, billing records and a

00:00:49.057 --> 00:00:50.287
hospital database.

00:00:50.327 --> 00:00:51.972
That comes from the agent's

00:00:51.772 --> 00:00:53.547
own reports, and no victim

00:00:53.347 --> 00:00:54.466
has confirmed it.

00:00:55.016 --> 00:00:56.552
Patch BroadWorks now.

00:00:56.592 --> 00:00:58.735
Treat internet facing J Boss

00:00:58.535 --> 00:00:59.979
six as compromised.

00:01:00.019 --> 00:01:02.458
Change default database passwords,

00:01:02.258 --> 00:01:03.340
clinical first.

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:06.171
Defenders counted on attackers being

00:01:05.971 --> 00:01:07.406
short of skilled hours.

00:01:07.446 --> 00:01:09.688
Snowball suggests trying every old

00:01:09.488 --> 00:01:11.731
flaw, everywhere, is now cheap.

00:01:12.281 --> 00:01:13.688
Read the full story on

00:01:13.488 --> 00:01:14.425
The Dispatch.

